  "ruleText": "Puc 206.02 Utility May Petition. A utility may file with the commission a petition for an alternative form of regulation.\n\nSource. #6444, eff 1-28-97; ss by #8276, eff 1-27-05; ss by #10306, eff 4-9-13; ss by #13780, eff 10-18-23; ss by #14184, eff 1-24-25",
